		"description": "AI Gateway Service endpoints (Gateway + Prompts + Tenant AI Config).\n\nBase URL: http://localhost:3000/api/v1\n\nAuth:\n- JWT only — Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}\n- JWT + API Key — Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}} + X-API-Key: {{api_key}}\n- API Key + Tenant — X-API-Key: {{api_key}} + X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant_id}}\n\nPermissions:\n- ai:read / ai:write / ai:delete\n\nNotes:\n- All AI endpoints are tenant-scoped.\n- IDs (completion_id, prompt_id, test_case_id) are auto-saved by test scripts where applicable.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "48835086"
	},
